{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>對於熱愛聆聽有聲書或音樂的使用者而言，一款介面簡潔且功能強大的播放工具至關重要。mPlayer 正是一款專為有聲書與音樂設計的簡易播放器，目前於 App Store 提供<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>下載優惠，讓用戶能輕鬆管理龐大的音訊庫並享受順暢的收聽體驗。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-272.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>進階播放控制</h2>\n<p>mPlayer 支援自動記錄播放進度、設定睡眠定時器及調整 0.25x 至 2x 的播放速度。用戶可透過檔案應用程式導入 MP3、M4A、M4B 和 FLAC 格式音訊，並利用均衡器自訂音效。此外，App 具備章節瀏覽、音訊書籤標記以及透過耳機進行快速跳轉的控制功能，確保在通話來電時自動暫停，並在重啟後恢復上次播放狀態，帶來極致便利的智能聆聽體驗。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-275-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-276-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-277-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-278-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-279-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：mPlayer – audiobook player</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mplayer-audiobook-player/id1493278962?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.097782+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":362,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:59:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:54:33.390781+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:23.983125+00:00","content_hash":"91d11c7d82d40b6b4c08b723bfbbf4f283385585485367b6d024513040456bc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}